Allow the W4A8C8 checkpoint's int8 indexer cache through config validation.

`cann_model.py:131` requests `indexer_kv_dtype="int8"`, which is what
GLM-5.2-w4a8c8 stores, and none of the pinned vllm trees list it: 35a49 has
["bf16", "fp8", "mxfp4", "nvfp4"] and a982 adds only "auto". The literal is a
validation list, not a code path, so the engine faults in pydantic before any
device work with

    ValidationError: 1 validation error for AttentionConfig
    indexer_kv_dtype
      Input should be 'auto', 'bf16', 'fp8', 'mxfp4' or 'nvfp4'

--- a/vllm/config/attention.py
+++ b/vllm/config/attention.py
@@ -13 +13 @@
-IndexerKVDType = Literal["auto", "bf16", "fp8", "mxfp4", "nvfp4"]
+IndexerKVDType = Literal["auto", "int8", "bf16", "fp8", "mxfp4", "nvfp4"]
